        <mxCell id="legend-content" value="• End-to-End Latency: 1.8 minutes (from post to dashboard)&#xa;• Ingestion Throughput: 100,000+ reports/hour during events&#xa;• Overall Accuracy: 94.2% in spotting false/manipulated news&#xa;• Redundancy Reduction: 70% of duplicate citizen reports filtered&#xa;• Multi-Modal: Text Validation + Image Forensics (ELA)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=14;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
